{"sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","items":[{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k001","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"광학현미경의 해상도는 파장과 개구수에 의존하며 전자현미경은 더 짧은 파장으로 높은 해상도를 제공한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k002","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"TEM은 얇은 단면의 내부 구조, SEM은 표면 구조 관찰에 유용하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k003","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"차등 원심분리는 침강 특성에 따라 분획을 얻고 밀도 기울기 원심분리는 밀도 또는 침강 차이를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k004","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"세포분획에는 교차오염 가능성이 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k005","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"유세포분석에서 FSC는 흔히 크기, SSC는 내부 복잡성과 관련되고 형광표지 항체로 표면·세포 내 표지를 분석할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k006","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"단일세포 gating, 생존세포 선별, 형광 compensation과 적절한 대조군이 필요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k007","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"DNA 염색을 통한 세포주기 분석에서는 G1이 2C, G2/M이 4C DNA량을 보인다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k008","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"Annexin V는 외부 노출 phosphatidylserine에 결합하며 PI와 함께 막 무결성을 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k009","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"ELISA는 항원-항체 결합과 효소 신호를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k010","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"FACS는 유세포분석과 세포 분류 기능을 결합할 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k011","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"FSC/SSC는 장비와 세포 종류에 따라 달라지는 상대 지표다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k012","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"양성·음성 대조군과 독립적 생물학 반복을 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k013","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"상관분석과 개입 실험은 인과 증거 수준이 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"bio-methods--cell-assays-k014","sectionId":"bio-methods/cell-assays","unitId":"bio-methods","subject":"biology","text":"일반적으로 불가능하며 추가 표지가 필요하다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}